WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,360
We were blind before

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,560
Don’t mention the past

3
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:05,360
We are the only ones who know about this today

4
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,760
Don't tell anyone that I gave it to you.

5
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:09,680
Just say that babies only understand how to change with others.

6
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:12,280
We will remember your kindness forever

7
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:14,080
This food is nothing to me

8
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:16,110
It is life-saving food for them

9
00:00:16,110 --> 00:00:17,710
Anyone who can help is one

10
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:33,420
Sooner or later, word will get out if you help people in private

11
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,420
Those who didn’t help will inevitably feel resentful.

12
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:38,480
There has to be a more comprehensive way to divide the meat.

13
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:40,110
Get a wild boar out

14
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:41,710
The whole village is divided by population

15
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:42,910
Meat is a happy event

16
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:43,910
Everyone has a share

17
00:00:43,910 --> 00:00:45,110
No one has anything to say
